			"byte_start": 1788,
			"byte_end": 1830,
			"text": "The four kinds of work"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 3269,
			"byte_end": 3294,
			"text": "The map"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 5050,
			"byte_end": 5105,
			"text": "What can wait, and what it holds up"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 7336,
			"byte_end": 7411,
			"text": "Websocket requests from a Router to central"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 11463,
			"byte_end": 11525,
			"text": "Calls from owners, admin and other objects"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 12575,
			"byte_end": 12637,
			"text": "What central sends to a Router"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 13880,
			"byte_end": 13922,
			"text": "Work that runs at a time"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-01.html",
			"source_sha256": "6ee9ec4076b71461ca2058aae9a384c52800b10996f7a0952b1ace9b1e842414",
			"byte_start": 15050,
			"byte_end": 15110,
			"text": "Flow control: the limits that stop floods"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 1067,
			"byte_end": 1116,
			"text": "Local storage (design 3): Program Design"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 1613,
			"byte_end": 1658,
			"text": "agent-router-update"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 3858,
			"byte_end": 3887,
			"text": "The steps"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 7672,
			"byte_end": 7743,
			"text": "Retiring the old id, store by store (step 0006)"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 9910,
			"byte_end": 9965,
			"text": "Who owns what after the update"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 12459,
			"byte_end": 12544,
			"text": "The Fleet database ( fleet.sqlite after step 0010)"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 14634,
			"byte_end": 14691,
			"text": "Enrolling belongs to Fleet access B3"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 15906,
			"byte_end": 15941,
			"text": "Scratch sweep"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 17203,
			"byte_end": 17267,
			"text": "Trace: each obligation to its owner and seam"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-02.html",
			"source_sha256": "4eeaefc2c8ccaf2020cac90fe806193f99cd7090d58fa51a9d9258bdd5b5995e",
			"byte_start": 18835,
			"byte_end": 18864,
			"text": "Depends on"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 639,
			"byte_end": 688,
			"text": "Requirements: workspace storage redesign"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 1080,
			"byte_end": 1113,
			"text": "Who this is for"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 1589,
			"byte_end": 1631,
			"text": "The shape, at a glance"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 2205,
			"byte_end": 2260,
			"text": "Capabilities and their needs"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 3353,
			"byte_end": 3399,
			"text": "C1 · Organize work"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 3417,
			"byte_end": 3485,
			"text": "U1 · Work is organized as workspace → areas → projects"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 3686,
			"byte_end": 3747,
			"text": "U2 · Initiatives are goals that cut across projects"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 3939,
			"byte_end": 3974,
			"text": "C2 · Roles"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 4346,
			"byte_end": 4411,
			"text": "U3 · A project has one lead, and optionally one advisor"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 4669,
			"byte_end": 4748,
			"text": "U13 · Each deliverable has its own implementer, verifier and reviewer"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 5039,
			"byte_end": 5090,
			"text": "C3 · Conversations"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 5474,
			"byte_end": 5582,
			"text": "U4 · Conversations live in an area. A thread may link to deliverables, and its creator resolves it"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 5814,
			"byte_end": 5905,
			"text": "U5 · Threads have participants and observers, many of each. Observers only follow"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 6065,
			"byte_end": 6116,
			"text": "C4 · Deliverables and tasks"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 6483,
			"byte_end": 6573,
			"text": "U7 · Deliverables are the lanes of a project, sequenced by blocked-by / blocking"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 6830,
			"byte_end": 6904,
			"text": "U6 · Tasks are simple, and every task belongs to one deliverable"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 7102,
			"byte_end": 7142,
			"text": "C5 · Work log"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 7383,
			"byte_end": 7433,
			"text": "U8 · Agents keep a work log you can read"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 7505,
			"byte_end": 7564,
			"text": "C6 · Messages and notifications"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 7967,
			"byte_end": 8019,
			"text": "U9 · All agent messages go through central"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 8151,
			"byte_end": 8227,
			"text": "U10 · Agents are told about activity they care about, from central"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 8412,
			"byte_end": 8469,
			"text": "C7 · Automations and wakes"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 8750,
			"byte_end": 8847,
			"text": "U11 · Automations and wakes are defined and fired in one central place, across machines"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 9080,
			"byte_end": 9133,
			"text": "C8 · Machines and sign-in"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 9394,
			"byte_end": 9464,
			"text": "U12 · A new Mac works as soon as it enrolls, with no seeding"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 9557,
			"byte_end": 9608,
			"text": "What the redesign must hold to"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 11185,
			"byte_end": 11228,
			"text": "What it does not do"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 11662,
			"byte_end": 11706,
			"text": "How you'll know it's done"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-03.html",
			"source_sha256": "1296d32988079004b2695b6213ec49423a24888e7aa5799b272ae9c34297a002",
			"byte_start": 11981,
			"byte_end": 12010,
			"text": "Confirm"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 1121,
			"byte_end": 1169,
			"text": "Central execution model: Program Design"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 3905,
			"byte_end": 3963,
			"text": "Three rules that make hibernation safe"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 5153,
			"byte_end": 5215,
			"text": "The engine core and its platform contract"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 6224,
			"byte_end": 6281,
			"text": "ObjectPlatform: the whole contract"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 9422,
			"byte_end": 9456,
			"text": "Closed shapes"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 11236,
			"byte_end": 11280,
			"text": "Events, per object type"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 12314,
			"byte_end": 12358,
			"text": "What every event does"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 15700,
			"byte_end": 15741,
			"text": "Units and containment"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 17477,
			"byte_end": 17537,
			"text": "The alarm: one owner, two operations"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 22277,
			"byte_end": 22349,
			"text": "A long step can delay other due work, boundedly"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 22873,
			"byte_end": 22937,
			"text": "Requests that start a long operation"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 23989,
			"byte_end": 24091,
			"text": "One table for every attempt: central_work_attempts (your decision)"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 28706,
			"byte_end": 28805,
			"text": "Who writes attempt rows when agent-fleet-sync changes an owed row"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 29643,
			"byte_end": 29716,
			"text": "Repeated failures are retired so nothing stays stuck"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 31351,
			"byte_end": 31404,
			"text": "Every subject is keyed by a UUIDv7"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 32269,
			"byte_end": 32321,
			"text": "Where every piece of state lives"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 35050,
			"byte_end": 35114,
			"text": "Keepalive, dead and replaced connections"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 36015,
			"byte_end": 36069,
			"text": "Same code on Tokio and Cloudflare"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 37076,
			"byte_end": 37141,
			"text": "Platform facts this design relies on"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 38682,
			"byte_end": 38718,
			"text": "Entity binding"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 40080,
			"byte_end": 40129,
			"text": "Trace: one row per obligation"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-04.html",
			"source_sha256": "92e10102e681216c24958dd19a80ac7b917c529976643714eb6840074621cf9f",
			"byte_start": 43131,
			"byte_end": 43170,
			"text": "Which code changes"
		},
