		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 6600,
			"byte_end": 6649,
			"text": "Create a worktree"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 6649,
			"byte_end": 6724,
			"text": "1. Choose the creation mode"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 7205,
			"byte_end": 7294,
			"text": "2. Validate and create on the Host"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 7860,
			"byte_end": 7945,
			"text": "3. Reconcile success and failure"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 8436,
			"byte_end": 8517,
			"text": "4. Prepare the repository view"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 8933,
			"byte_end": 9020,
			"text": "5. Apply the result in the UX client"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 9443,
			"byte_end": 9562,
			"text": "6. Integrate and prove the whole worktree feature"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 10057,
			"byte_end": 10111,
			"text": "Review an annotated diff"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 10111,
			"byte_end": 10186,
			"text": "1. Read the addressed source"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 10609,
			"byte_end": 10716,
			"text": "2. Publish the view and track actual viewing"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 11341,
			"byte_end": 11416,
			"text": "3. Edit and save annotations"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 11871,
			"byte_end": 11958,
			"text": "4. Prepare an exact output attempt"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 12415,
			"byte_end": 12500,
			"text": "5. Perform the destination effect"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-11.html",
			"source_sha256": "9530a9085f41b7c708ca6008c4e9c1cf55a3d63a22cf3b9c39a56625c856bd95",
			"byte_start": 12990,
			"byte_end": 13103,
			"text": "6. Integrate and prove the whole review feature"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 456,
			"byte_end": 518,
			"text": "Program Design · One Rust engine, multiple consumers"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 842,
			"byte_end": 881,
			"text": "Who owns what"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 2007,
			"byte_end": 2052,
			"text": "Why this structure"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 3489,
			"byte_end": 3549,
			"text": "Current source and changed calls"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 6632,
			"byte_end": 6694,
			"text": "Root and origin call-path changes"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 7745,
			"byte_end": 7800,
			"text": "Entity homes and boundary shapes"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 10572,
			"byte_end": 10620,
			"text": "The input and result shapes"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 17860,
			"byte_end": 17925,
			"text": "Ast-grep: precise types without a fork"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 19978,
			"byte_end": 20021,
			"text": "Load, check and run"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 21398,
			"byte_end": 21455,
			"text": "Cancellation, overlap and failure"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 24626,
			"byte_end": 24677,
			"text": "Packaging and compatibility"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 25514,
			"byte_end": 25579,
			"text": "One realization row per observable obligation"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-12.html",
			"source_sha256": "ea15f4335650fdf59bbf24c920a714ed72f6569b90e85141f8d2fd24cfd6a3a4",
			"byte_start": 32220,
			"byte_end": 32275,
			"text": "Enforcement and excluded machinery"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 1120,
			"byte_end": 1167,
			"text": "How work runs: today vs the new design"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 1593,
			"byte_end": 1683,
			"text": "1. Before: a request becomes a job behind cleanup, and waits in memory"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 2824,
			"byte_end": 2888,
			"text": "2. New: a request is answered in its event"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 3290,
			"byte_end": 3365,
			"text": "3. New: mail is an owed row; the answer is its own event"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 4216,
			"byte_end": 4296,
			"text": "4. New: an object hibernating with its Routers connected"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 4908,
			"byte_end": 4982,
			"text": "5. New: reconnect drains the backlog, paced by answers"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 5716,
			"byte_end": 5794,
			"text": "6. New: a retry needs a timer only when no event will come"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 6496,
			"byte_end": 6574,
			"text": "7. New: cleanup is its own unit and can't block anything"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 7076,
			"byte_end": 7154,
			"text": "8. New: long operations keep today's engine behind one seam"
		},
		{
			"file": "pages/page-13.html",
			"source_sha256": "af26efa1ce441db8aca29f1889e851c8b8092d0386fa1b4ff17c1d10edd16f99",
			"byte_start": 7803,
			"byte_end": 7858,
			"text": "Every kind of work, and how it runs"
		}
	]
}
